Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mama, lots of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.33,0:02:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being so patient.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.89,0:02:17.89,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fscx90\fscy120\fax-0.12\fs20\b1\pos(276,78)\frz6.409\frx0\fry344\c&HE4FBF8&}Shinei College Camping Club
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got those sours for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.15,0:02:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Gero's up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a college welcome party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard the legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought my job would take me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New students! Move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for all of us starting\Ncollege and meeting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a first-year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the party getting\Nyou excited for school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having tons of fun over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did we say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.93,0:03:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my chance to talk to\Nupperclassmen and I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hire you as a bodyguard for my\Nniece who starts university this spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If possible, be discreet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't stand out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Shiori Ureshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.77,0:03:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her father was my older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He built this company from the\Nground up in a single generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He passed away from an illness a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But according to the terms of his will,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.02,0:04:00.28,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\bord1.2\fscx90\shad0\blur0.3\fs10\3c&HA5CADB&\pos(414,70)}Hold still while balancing a tray!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiori will succeed him as\NCEO once she comes of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, there are some who didn't\Nagree with his final decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My older sister, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She claims Balzac is rightfully hers.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.21,0:04:15.71,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fnTimes New Roman\blur0.3\fs14\bord1\shad0\fscx\3c&H393A3F&\pos(143,210)}Second Son\NMitsuhiko
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.21,0:04:15.71,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fnTimes New Roman\blur0.3\fs14\bord1\shad0\fscx\3c&H393A3F&\pos(338,218)}Eldest Daughter\NFutae
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.21,0:04:15.71,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fnTimes New Roman\blur0.3\fs14\bord1\shad0\fscx\3c&H393A3F&\pos(474,203.5)}Eldest Son (Deceased)\NKazuhito
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cards on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what she'll attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But rumor is, she's gone and\Nhired a professional herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone with strange techniques\Nthat no ordinary expert can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thanks for taking the job.
